&lt;li&gt;Participate in audit processes by supporting evidence collection, validating controls, documenting configurations, and helping close identified gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of Salesforce security architecture, including profiles, roles, permission sets, field-level security, object access, and sharing rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support platform stability and day-to-day operational activities by troubleshooting issues, resolving user requests, and maintaining data integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business stakeholders to understand requirements, improve processes, and recommend scalable platform solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
