&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Python or R with a strong focus on data wrangling and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Tableau or another leading visualization tool is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing complex people data (e.g. headcount, attrition, recruiting metrics, compensation data) strongly preferred but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data architecture fundamentals and data warehousing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with data modeling and data quality best practices&lt;/li&gt;
