&lt;li&gt;Atlas (fully managed cloud database service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlas Data Lake&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlas Full-Text Search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlas Vector Search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlas stream processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other Tools and connectors - Ops/Cloud Manager, Compass, Connector for BI, Connector for Spark, Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-relevant, complementary technologies e.g. Apache Kafka, Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern and popular architecture design patterns, methodologies and concerns e.g. microservices, event-driven architectures, cloud, security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales techniques and related soft skills - presentations, demonstrations, whiteboarding, discovery, objection handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to a wide variety of market verticals and broad spectrum of interesting use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
