&lt;li&gt;Prepare analysis and documentation of income tax positions in compliance with FIN48 (Accounting for Uncertain Tax Positions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Federal, State, and Local Tax Filings:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
